<title>GERMANY: Heilit &amp; Woerner 96 gp net profit 3.0 mln. [CORRECTED 09:07 GMT]</title>
<headline>Heilit &amp; Woerner 96 gp net profit 3.0 mln. [CORRECTED 09:07 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to million from billion.)</p>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	   3.0     vs	 11.5</p>
<p>    Group DVFA EPS	     8.0     vs	 14.6 marks</p>
<p>    Group turnover	     3,376		3,606</p>
<p>    --of which domestic	2,764		3,051</p>
<p>    --of which foreign	   612		  555</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders    3,684		3,196</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand     2,946		2,638</p>
<p>    NOTE - Full name of the German building group is Heilit + Woerner Bau-AG. The company said in a statement it was &quot;confident about all of 1997&quot;.</p>
<p>    --Bonn Newsroom + 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
